  "description": "*“Freedom at last!”*\n\nAfter fifteen long years of secluded training, he finally descends the mountain, determined to reclaim the youth he feels he wasted. He vows to complete the ten great deeds promised to his master as swiftly as possible, then live the rest of his life in blissful leisure. Brimming with confidence, he takes his first steps into the world—only to find that nothing goes as planned. In a realm where betrayal and tears far outweigh righteousness and laughter, his journey toward becoming the world’s greatest warrior begins. Join him now on his path through this perilous martial world!",
